    "created_at": "2015-08-30T07:31:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-30T07:31:52Z",
    "body": "Agreed I guess there are currently inconsistencies in what’s included and what’s not. But for the time being I just raised this to resolve the one open W3C bugzilla bug we had specifically for this one attribute.\n\nFor the larger problem, I suppose we should open a new issue here to track it—so that somebody can go through the section and audit it against, I guess, what’s in the https://html-differences.whatwg.org/ doc, and raise a PR with the changes that come out of doing that.\n",
